Bonjour Everyone!

I am trying to get the video working on an iMac 24" Core 2 Duo with an
integrated GeForce 7600 GT.
The installation disk I am using  (Ubuntu Trusty Tahir 14.04.5 LTS modified
for the mac) loads nouveau and tries to use the 304 drivers, but fails.

The story of the problem is documented here, but not the solution (yet)

http://mymanthemaker.blogspot.hk/2017/03/imac-ubuntu-
install-gone-wrong-install.html

When I boot the machine, in the end, this is what I see:

[image: Inline image 1]

I have tried a LOT of different approaches, including trying to disable the
nouveau kernel module and installing the following proprietary NVIDIA
driver:

NVIDIA-Linux-x86_64-304.135.run

But I have had no luck at all.
Before anyone asks me if the video card is messed up, I have seen proper
"graphics" displayed on this machine before, sometimes during boot:

[image: Inline image 2]

And I ONCE in a user session got a proper video screen with "xinit" that
provided me with an old-school xterm and the classic "cross" mouse cursor.
But when I moved the mouse, or when I stared "xeyes", the machine froze.

How can I get some help with troubleshooting this problem?

The dmesg errors I am seeing are:

[  642.016069] nouveau 0000:01:00.0: DRM: Calling LVDS script 6:
[  642.016075] nouveau 0000:01:00.0: DRM: 0xC165: Parsing digital output
script table
(this is a unique entry)

[    8.978307] nouveau 0000:01:00.0: fifo: CACHE_ERROR - ch 0 [DRM] subc 3
mthd 0d94 data ffffffff
[    8.978323] nouveau 0000:01:00.0: fifo: CACHE_ERROR - ch 0 [DRM] subc 3
mthd 0d98 data ffffffff
[    8.981130] nouveau 0000:01:00.0: fifo: CACHE_ERROR - ch 0 [DRM] subc 3
mthd 0d9c data ffffffff
[    8.983911] nouveau 0000:01:00.0: fifo: CACHE_ERROR - ch 0 [DRM] subc 3
mthd 0da0 data ffffffff
(thousands of the above are in my dmesg log)

Also, I don't know if the GeForce 7600 GT uses "low memory" but I am
getting the following error:

[   66.016047] Corrupted low memory at ffff8800000019c0 (19c0 phys) =
4f000000
[   66.016932] ------------[ cut here ]------------
